<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 11.5 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves rise FIM 11.5 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for January 23 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to January 15.</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 63,674	 52,220</p>
<p> Money market intervention    11,558	 11,558</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		1,907	  1,906</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,265	  2,265</p>
<p> Total assets		     86,230	 74,311</p>
<p>In the previous week to January 15, reserves rose by 15.7 billion markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
